                        <p class="h5 fw-bold underline-anim" style="max-width: 30ch;"><span>Explore how your organisation can engage with Offshore Energies UK (OEUK), the leading representative body for the UK offshore energy industry.</span></p>                            <style>
                    .p-width p{
                        max-width: 62ch;
                    }
                </style>
                <div class="mt-5 ps-4 mb-0 border-start p-width ms-lg-5">
                    <p class="" data-start="255" data-end="404">Download our latest resources to learn more about joining OEUK’s membership community and promoting your brand through our trusted industry channels.</p>
